00:27:01.150 --> 00:27:02.960
Distroless is just
the default we use.

00:27:02.960 --> 00:27:05.312
There's an option to
change where you're

00:27:05.312 --> 00:27:06.520
pulling your base image from.

00:27:06.520 --> 00:27:10.548
You can use Alpine
or whatever you want.

